      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Leão-Marinho. Popplio controla balões feitos de água e treina diligentemente para conseguir criar exemplares maiores. A cada dia de prática, as bolhas infladas por seu nariz aumentam de tamanho.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo, Água 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 88% M / 12% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Popplio pode evoluir para Brionne no nível 6 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Pound, Water Gun</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Growl</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Disarming Voice</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Baby-Doll Eyes</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Aqua Jet</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Encore, Icy Wind</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Bubble Beam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Sing</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Double Slap</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Hyper Voice</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Moonblast</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Captivate</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Hydro Pump, Misty Terrain</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Acrobatics, Amnesia, Aqua Tail, Attract, Blizzard, Brine, Charm, Chilling Water, Confide, Covet, Disarming Voice, Dive, Double Team, Draining Kiss, Echoed Voice, Encore, Endure, Facade, Flip Turn, Frustration, Hail, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Hydro Pump, Hyper Voice, Ice Beam, Ice Spinner, Icy Wind, Iron Tail, Misty Terrain, Play Rough, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Round, Scald, Sleep Talk, Snore, Substitute, Surf, Swagger, Swift, Tera Blast, Toxic, Triple Axel, Uproar, Water Pledge, Water Pulse, Waterfall, Whirlpool, Wonder Room, Work Up</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Amnesia, Aqua Ring, Aromatic Mist, Charm, Life Dew, Perish Song, Wonder Room</p>",
